    1   -1.40530293e-01 -1.40530293e-01 5.80e-11    -2.27746361e-01 -2.27746361e-01 7.71e-10    
        Phi'' : fd 7.37592210e-01  closed 7.37568359e-01  rel 3.23e-05
    2   +1.25086948e-01 +1.25086948e-01 4.71e-11    +2.62190246e-01 +2.62190246e-01 2.42e-11    
        Phi'' : fd 5.29998267e-01  closed 5.29999055e-01  rel 1.49e-06
    3   +1.21897735e-01 +1.21897735e-01 1.10e-10    +5.55732566e-01 +5.55732566e-01 6.97e-11    
